        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Message from the Development Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We’ve seen that some players have already tried the game and left feedback. Thank you for taking the time to share your thoughts. ❤</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The current version is a concept demo, and you may encounter bugs or incomplete features. We are currently working on improvements and fixes for the next update. For now, we recommend waiting for a future version, which will offer a more polished and complete experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your understanding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Stories Adrift: Wake - Prologue&quot; is a 2D point-and-click narrative-driven puzzle adventure game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new owner of a book boat, you are entrusted with returning a single page of a book and embarks on a journey through a world both mysterious and familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By solving intricate puzzles and piecing together scattered clues, you uncover the truth of the world - and of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% hand-painted visuals</strong> delivering a deeply atmospheric experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159900/extras/238daf3c3e61eaad76e7c14385d2ef4d.avif?t=1771196569\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven puzzles</strong> where you investigate with a detective’s intuition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159900/extras/2fde3d4bd691a4b112a917008e49ac5c.avif?t=1771196569\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original and multilayered worldbuilding</strong> inspired by diverse ancient cultures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159900/extras/07e7c0fa1fbbf9ced844a0eb7e0fabb3.avif?t=1771196569\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A parabolic tale</strong> crafted in homage to Jorge Luis Borges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159900/extras/6f5dcc9ea2f20d95cecf96dd714c04f2.avif?t=1771196569\" width=1560 height=438 /></span> </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Message from the Development Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We’ve seen that some players have already tried the game and left feedback. Thank you for taking the time to share your thoughts. ❤</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The current version is a concept demo, and you may encounter bugs or incomplete features. We are currently working on improvements and fixes for the next update. For now, we recommend waiting for a future version, which will offer a more polished and complete experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for your understanding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Stories Adrift: Wake - Prologue&quot; is a 2D point-and-click narrative-driven puzzle adventure game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new owner of a book boat, you are entrusted with returning a single page of a book and embarks on a journey through a world both mysterious and familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By solving intricate puzzles and piecing together scattered clues, you uncover the truth of the world - and of yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% hand-painted visuals</strong> delivering a deeply atmospheric experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159900/extras/238daf3c3e61eaad76e7c14385d2ef4d.avif?t=1771196569\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven puzzles</strong> where you investigate with a detective’s intuition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159900/extras/2fde3d4bd691a4b112a917008e49ac5c.avif?t=1771196569\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original and multilayered worldbuilding</strong> inspired by diverse ancient cultures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159900/extras/07e7c0fa1fbbf9ced844a0eb7e0fabb3.avif?t=1771196569\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A parabolic tale</strong> crafted in homage to Jorge Luis Borges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159900/extras/6f5dcc9ea2f20d95cecf96dd714c04f2.avif?t=1771196569\" width=1560 height=438 /></span> </p>",
